ho de Markkanen. O aproveitamento nos lances livres foi decisivo! O que achou dessa rota\u00e7\u00e3o de Utah para a temporada? Comenta a\u00ed! \ud83d\udc47\n\n\n\n#NBA #Suns #UtahJazz #Basquete"}]}, {"team": "uta", "query": "\"Utah Jazz\"", "hour": "2026-10-17T20:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "uta", "query": "\"Utah Jazz\"", "hour": "2026-10-17T21:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:3y5hccpr4c77mmtlahv4ekzf/app.bsky.feed.post/3my3z7rhnai2b", "author_did": "did:plc:3y5hccpr4c77mmtlahv4ekzf", "handle": "iceinmyveinsdata.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-17T21:16:31.302734+00:00", "indexed_at": "2026-10-17T21:16:32.257Z", "text": "The Utah Jazz claimed Tony Bradley off waivers, bringing the center back to Salt Lake City."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:4kxaujevio7kizmcshgxvseq/app.bsky.feed.post/3my3yklfvbc2x", "author_did": "did:plc:4kxaujevio7kizmcshgxvseq", "handle": "kingfitch1990.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-17T21:04:40.353Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-17T21:04:43.063Z", "text": "The Utah Jazz have claimed center Tony Bradley off free agency waivers, sources tell ESPN. Bradley was the Jazz's No. 28 pick in 2017 and now returns where he spent his first 3 NBA seasons. www.espn.com/contributor/... espn.com/app"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:sa73fbx3vxzh2fw5pu5wmief/app.bsky.feed.post/3my3yqxwvkt2n", "author_did": "did:plc:sa73fbx3vxzh2fw5pu5wmief", "handle": "shamsbot.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-17T21:04:15.000Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-17T21:08:14.962Z", "text": "The Utah Jazz have claimed center Tony Bradley off free agency waivers, sources tell ESPN. Bradley was the Jazz's No. 28 pick in 2017 and now returns where he spent his first 3 NBA seasons."}]}, {"team": "uta", "query": "\"Utah Jazz\"", "hour": "2026-10-17T22:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:v6dbf7zrv2iauhimhtyzkbtc/app.bsky.feed.post/3my43o6xocw2d", "author_did": "did:plc:v6dbf7zrv2iauhimhtyzkbtc", "handle": "joshlloyd.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-17T22:00:22.704Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-17T22:00:23.661Z", "text": "Jaren Jackson Jr. and Keyonte George are the Utah Jazz players I\u2019m targeting at their current prices."}]}, {"team": "uta", "query": "\"Utah Jazz\"", "hour": "2026-10-17T23:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:jhpaded4rjtmgadp2k7lcf7d/app.bsky.feed.post/3my4c4zevrc2o", "author_did": "did:plc:jhpaded4rjtmgadp2k7lcf7d", "handle": "thebstiles.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-17T23:56:02.657Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-17T23:56:03.656Z", "text": "The Utah Jazz mascot is a bear."}]}]